# ─── Worker local secrets ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# This file is read by `wrangler dev` for local development.
# NEVER commit this file — it is in .gitignore.
#
# Generate a strong JWT secret (PowerShell):
#   [System.Convert]::ToBase64String([System.Security.Cryptography.RandomNumberGenerator]::GetBytes(48))
#
# Then paste the result below:

JWT_SECRET=replace-with-a-strong-random-base64-secret-at-least-32-bytes
